@startuml
!theme plain

<style>
title {
  FontSize 20
  FontColor #333333
}
node {
  BackgroundColor #F5F5F5
  BorderColor #666666
}
frame {
  BackgroundColor #E3F2FD
  BorderColor #1565C0
}
database {
  BackgroundColor #FFF9C4
  BorderColor #F57F17
}
component {
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    BorderColor #1565C0
    FontColor #1A237E
    roundCorner 15
    shadowing true
}
</style>

title Arquitectura Inicial (Single Server)

actor "Usuario" as User

node "Host (Servidor Básico)" {
  note top: 2 cores, 2GB RAM, 50GB SSD
  frame "Docker Compose" {
    component "NGINX\n(Proxy Inverso)" as Nginx
    
    package "Servicios de Aplicación" {
      component "Backend\n(Ruby on Rails API)" as Backend
      component "Frontend\n(Expo for Web)" as Frontend
    }

    database "MySQL" as DB {
      folder "Volumen Persistente"
    }
    
    folder "Storage Local" as Storage {
        note "Volumen para\nActiveStorage" as NStorage
    }
  }
}

User --> Nginx : Petición HTTPS
Nginx --> Frontend : Sirve la PWA
Frontend -> Nginx : Peticiones a /api/*
Nginx --> Backend : Redirige a la API
Backend <--> DB : Lee/Escribe datos
Backend <--> Storage : Gestiona archivos

note right of Backend
  **Lógica de Negocio**
  - API RESTful (JSON)
  - Autenticación JWT
  - Concurrencia: 1 Worker, 5 Threads
end note

note bottom of DB
  **Persistencia Principal**
  - Datos de usuarios, citas, etc.
  - Backups diarios programados
end note

@enduml